Changes made by Feida Wang: renamed to Edit Replay; ported to the Claude Code
2.1.286 mods API (all drawing state lives in `$.state`, with a typed contract);
rewrote the diff recorder to read the tools' structured patches (hooks/diff.ts),
the film-strip hint band and its SVG art (hooks/art.ts), the /replay pane and
band fallback; made the hint band stack with other plugins' bands through
`next(e)`; added tests that run on both the terminal and desktop surfaces,
documentation, a listing icon, and packaging for the Claude plugin directory.

